    ('transportation-priorities', 3, 'Voted YES (5-0) on Resolution No. 2910 (Feb 3, 2026) authorizing grant applications for two transit projects with $175,000 in transit transportation-impact-fee funds as local match; personally MOVED adoption of Ordinance No. 6515 (Transportation System Plan update, May 5, 2026, 5-0); voted YES Nov 18, 2025 on the consent IGA with Washington County ($12,500 match) for a Commuter Transportation Needs Assessment; May 5, 2026 consent yes on $2.7M Pavement Management Program (road maintenance). Campaign priority: "Improve the transportation systems so that they can work for everyone." Matches Chair 3 (maintain roads while selectively adding transit connections and pedestrian improvements).', ARRAY['https://hillsboro-oregon.civicweb.net/document/256729/City%20Council%20-%2003%20Feb%202026.pdf', 'https://www.sabaanvery.com']::text[]),
